            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>specialty; do not confuse with <a href="/record/ui?ui=D009313" class="textLink_NATIONALHEALTHPROGRAMS">NATIONAL HEALTH PROGRAMS</a></dd>
        </span>
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Branch of medicine concerned with the prevention and control of disease and disability, and the promotion of physical and mental health of the population on the international, national, state, or municipal level.</dd>
                </span>
            
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Community Health
                    
